        "category": "ancestry",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Gremlins aren't really known for their disguises, but they're distinctive-looking fey. Sometimes you need to walk among mortals without having things thrown at you. You can cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Illusory Disguise] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Illusory Object] once per day as a primal innate spell. If you're Tiny, you can use this <em>illusory disguise</em> to appear as a Small creature. At 7th level, the spell is heightened to 2nd rank, and every 2 levels thereafter, the spell is heightened an additional spell rank.</p>"
        },
